kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_20","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Cette fois, sois encore plus attentif à tes sensations. Te sens-tu aussi à l’aise que d’habitude, ou la fatigue commence-t-elle à peser en fin de course ? Si c’est le cas, reste vigilant pour la suite de la semaine : tu es dans une phase bénéfique, mais attention à ne pas basculer dans une fatigue excessive qui pourrait te freiner.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 3 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 4 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 4 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause à la spécifité que les durées et répétitions diminuent de série en série et que l'intensité diminue. Prend 2'  de récupération entre les séries. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Le renforcement est un complément à la course, pas une compétition. Le lendemain de ta séance, tu ne dois pas être cassé en deux (même sur les séances les plus difficiles). Alors si tu te sens épuisé, n'hésite pas à utiliser une variante d'exercice plus simple sur quelques répétitions par série.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":12,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"sWHMMIyy4h2UCt1nRa02ESjPpivqnf018d","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"dic02Ysz02AmD200oMRCvd900hIc3lw01Jh85","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"jhDR01T1PHx5t1KEXnb2U1G2Hcejfp01IY","format":"mobile"}]}],"gear":"weights","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle"}},{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":12,"durations":[],"gea